Package: com.sahinkaa.neverlowermusic16
Name: Never Lower Music
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Prevents notification sounds from lowering now-playing audio. During playback, notification volume follows media volume.
 Tested on iPhone 8 Plus (iOS 16.6, Dopamine RootHide via conversion) and iPhone 11 Pro Max (iOS 26.0.1, Dopamine 3 RootHide).
Maintainer: sahinkaa
Author: Rishanan • sahinkaa
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate
